Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:55:08 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 42/64] dt-bindings: spi: samsung: Add Exynos9810 SPI

Exynos9810 SPI controllers are USIv2 based and compatible with the
Exynos850 ones (64 byte FIFO on the CHUB instances, input clock divided
by 4), so add a compatible with the Exynos850 fallback. Instances with a
different FIFO depth use the "fifo-depth" property.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
index 1ce8b2770..8893483e3 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - samsung,exynos8895-spi
+              - samsung,exynos9810-spi
               - samsung,exynosautov920-spi
           - const: samsung,exynos850-spi
       - const: samsung,exynos7-spi
